# Local .rar snapshots of the Editor tree. Kept on disk, out of git: three of
# them already account for roughly 200 MB, they are not diffable, and each new
# one would add its full size to history permanently. The three that predate
# this file are still in the history and untracking them here does not shrink
# it - this only stops the pile growing.
backups/
*.rar

# Installed dependencies, restored with `npm install` in Multiplayer/server -
# package.json and package-lock.json are tracked, so the tree is reproducible.
# They were committed (2215 files) and every repo-wide search had to wade
# through them to reach the handful of files anyone actually edits.
node_modules/

# Server run log, regenerated on every start.
server.log
